---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title={`有趣知识 | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-kicker">Interesting</p>
      <h1>奇奇怪怪的知识又增加了</h1>
      <p>一些不够长到单独成文、但值得记下来的小知识。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="article-shell article-body">
      <h2>浏览器原生中文分词</h2>
      <p>
        浏览器原生的 <code>Intl.Segmenter</code> API 可以进行文本分词，支持中文。
        <a href="https://jsbin.com/lubujejoke/edit?js,console" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          查看示例
        </a>
      </p>
      <figure class="highlight plaintext">
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="code">
              <pre><span class="line">let segmenter = new Intl.Segmenter("zh-CN", &#123; granularity: "word" &#125;);</span><br><span class="line">let input = "Intl.Segmenter API 是浏览器原生的分词 API。";</span><br><span class="line">let segments = segmenter.segment(input);</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">for (let &#123; segment, index, isWordLike &#125; of segments) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  console.log(</span><br><span class="line">    "字符串位置 [%d, %d): %s%s",</span><br><span class="line">    index,</span><br><span class="line">    index + segment.length,</span><br><span class="line">    segment,</span><br><span class="line">    isWordLike ? " [单词]" : ""</span><br><span class="line">  );</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span></pre>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </figure>

      <h2>解构赋值默认值</h2>
      <p>ES6 解构赋值的默认值只有在值严格等于 <code>undefined</code> 时才会生效。</p>
      <figure class="highlight plaintext">
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="code">
              <pre><span class="line">const foo = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">  name: 'xiuyuan',</span><br><span class="line">  age: null</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">const &#123; name = '华仔', age = '18', sex = '男' &#125; = foo;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">console.log(age); // null</span><br><span class="line">console.log(sex); // '男'</span></pre>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </figure>

      <h2>让整个网页可编辑</h2>
      <p>调试页面文案或布局时，可以临时打开页面编辑能力。</p>
      <blockquote>
        <p><code>document.body.contentEditable = true</code></p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
